        "original_id": "a7a46172-2afa-5a76-bb3d-5db800b06acd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Progonat, Tepelenë, Gjirokastër County, Albania, Vjosa River, Drino\n- Organizations: Kurvelesh municipality, Tepelenë municipality\n- People: Ismet Toto\n- Roles: bureaucrat, publicist, writer, revolutionary\n\nFacts:\n- Progonat is a village in Gjirokastër County and was formerly part of Kurvelesh municipality.\n- Ismet Toto was born in Progonat in 1908 and died in Gjirokastër in 1937.\n- Ismet Toto was an Albanian bureaucrat, publicist, writer, and revolutionary.\n- In 2015, the local government reform placed Progonat in the municipality of Tepelenë.\n- Tepelenë is a town and a municipality in Gjirokastër County in southern Albania.\n- The town of Tepelenë lies on the left bank of the Vjosa River, about three kilometres downstream from its confluence with the Drino.",
